class.description:
A list of [DialogueSpeaker]s. Dialogue lines, subtitle segments and subtitle files name their speaker by a text id; this list resolves the id to the speaker's name, portrait, color and voice.
Save it as a [code].tres[/code] file and set its path in [member ProjectSettings.audio/subtitles/speakers]: the engine loads it into [member SubtitleServer.speakers] at startup and registers the speakers' TTS personas at [TTSServer]. Changing a speaker emits [signal Resource.changed] of the list.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
var speakers = SubtitleServer.speakers
if speakers.has_speaker(&"anna"):
    print(speakers.get_speaker(&"anna").get_translated_name())
for problem in speakers.validate():
    push_warning(problem)
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
DialogueSpeakers speakers = SubtitleServer.Speakers;
if (speakers.HasSpeaker("anna"))
{
    GD.Print(speakers.GetSpeaker("anna").GetTranslatedName());
}
foreach (string problem in speakers.Validate())
{
    GD.PushWarning(problem);
}
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
